{"passive":{"name":"Mark of the Kindred","description":"Kindred can mark targets to Hunt. Successfully completing a Hunt permanently empowers Kindred's basic abilities. Every 4 hunts completed also increases Kindred's basic attack range."},"primaryAbilities":[{"slot":"Q","name":"Dance of Arrows","enginePath":"Characters/Kindred/Spells/KindredQAbility/KindredQ","maxRank":5,"description":"Kindred tumbles and shoots up to three arrows at nearby targets.","tooltipTemplate":"Kindred vaults, firing an arrow at up to 3 enemies, dealing <physicalDamage>{{ totaldamage }} physical damage</physicalDamage> and gaining <attackSpeed>{{ totalqattackspeed }} Attack Speed</attackSpeed> for {{ baseasduration }} seconds.<br /><br />While inside of <spellName>Wolf's Frenzy</spellName>, this Ability's Cooldown is reduced to {{ cdnewvalue }} seconds.{{ spellmodifierdescriptionappend }}","cooldownByRank":[9,9,9,9,9],"costByRank":[35,35,35,35,35],"rangeByRank":[340,340,340,340,340],"resourceTemplate":"{{ cost }} {{ abilityresourcename }}"},{"slot":"W","name":"Wolf's Frenzy","enginePath":"Characters/Kindred/Spells/KindredWAbility/KindredW","maxRank":5,"description":"Wolf enrages and attacks enemies around him.  Lamb passively gains stacks by moving and attacking. When fully charged, Lamb's next attack restores health.","tooltipTemplate":"<spellPassive>Passive:</spellPassive> Kindred gains stacks as they move and attack. At 100 stacks, Kindred's next Attack restores up to <healing>{{ attackheal }} Health</healing> based on their missing Health.<br /><br /><spellActive>Active:</spellActive> Kindred claims a territory, ordering Wolf to bite at the last enemy Lamb Attacked. Wolf's bites deal <magicDamage>{{ basewolfdamage }}</magicDamage> plus <magicDamage>{{ percentwolfdamage }} current Health magic damage</magicDamage>.{{ spellmodifierdescriptionappend }}","cooldownByRank":[18,17,16,15,14],"costByRank":[40,40,40,40,40],"rangeByRank":[560,560,560,560,560],"resourceTemplate":"{{ cost }} {{ abilityresourcename }}"},{"slot":"E","name":"Mounting Dread","enginePath":"Characters/Kindred/Spells/KindredEWrapperAbility/KindredEWrapper","maxRank":5,"description":"Lamb fires a carefully placed shot, slowing the target. If Lamb attacks the target two more times, her third attack instead directs Wolf to pounce on the enemy, savaging them for massive damage.","tooltipTemplate":"Kindred weakens an enemy, <status>Slowing</status> them by {{ totalslow }}% for {{ slowduration }} second.<br /><br />Kindred's third Attack against the target within {{ totalduration }} seconds of each other directs Wolf to pounce on the enemy, dealing an additional <physicalDamage>{{ basebitedamage }}</physicalDamage> plus <physicalDamage>{{ percentbitedamage }} missing Health physical damage</physicalDamage>.{{ spellmodifierdescriptionappend }}","cooldownByRank":[14,12.5,11,9.5,8],"costByRank":[0,0,0,0,0],"rangeByRank":[500,500,500,500,500],"resourceTemplate":"{{ cost }} {{ abilityresourcename }}"},{"slot":"R","name":"Lamb's Respite","enginePath":"Characters/Kindred/Spells/KindredRAbility/KindredR","maxRank":3,"description":"Lamb grants all living things inside a zone a respite from death. Until the effect ends, nothing can die. At the end, units are healed.","tooltipTemplate":"Kindred blesses the ground for {{ buffduration }} seconds, allowing no unit, ally, enemy, or neutral to die while inside. Upon reaching 10% Health, units can't be damaged or healed while still inside the zone.<br /><br />When the blessing ends, all units inside heal for <healing>{{ healflat }} Health</healing>.{{ spellmodifierdescriptionappend }}","cooldownByRank":[160,140,120],"costByRank":[100,100,100],"rangeByRank":[500,500,500],"resourceTemplate":"{{ cost }} {{ abilityresourcename }}"}],"allSpellRecords":[{"path":"Characters/Kindred/Spells/KindredQAbility/KindredQMissileMinor","internalName":"KindredQMissileMinor","primarySlot":null,"name":"KindredQMissileMinor","summary":"","tooltipWithSymbolicValues":"","dataVal